.TH tumd n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tumd \- small dependency-free Markdown helpers.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
package require tclutils::tumd
.fi
.SH COMMANDS
.nf
::tclutils::tumd::toHtml markdown
::tclutils::tumd::headings markdown
::tclutils::tumd::toc markdown
::tclutils::tumd::frontmatter markdown
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Converts a practical CommonMark subset to an HTML fragment, extracts ATX
headings, creates a Markdown table of contents, and splits YAML front matter.
.SH LIMITS
.PP
This is not a full Markdown parser. Nested lists, Setext headings, GFM tables,
reference-style links, raw HTML passthrough, and a full AST are intentionally
outside the scope.
.SH SEE ALSO
tclutils(n), tucsv(n), tujson(n), tuxml(n)
